From a1b5863b0c8b77cfe2ff1bd67aa0dbd81660fc6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spyoham <98806847+spyoham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:50:07 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat: support works played in the tessvm runner

tessvm (the "tessvm for Entry" extension) replaces the play page's Entry
iframe with its own runner, so the page has no window.Entry and Entry Sync
did nothing there. inject.js now also binds to the runner tessvm leaves at
window.tessvm (vm.variables, vm.start/stop/reset/tick): room data, remote
updates and the '?!' status variable are written into its variables, local
changes (found by each variable's revision counter) are sent once per tick,
and stop / page unload send the ?? and ?! snapshots. The rules match the
Entry path (4 s startup gate, whole-list sends, no echo). Nothing changes
for pages that run Entry itself.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 extension/inject.js | 265 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 263 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/extension/inject.js b/extension/inject.js
index 69e1004..27dee78 100644
--- a/extension/inject.js
+++ b/extension/inject.js
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
  * 2. '??' Data Only Variables/Lists (Firebase fetch on start, Firebase save on stop)
  * 3. '!!' Sync Only Variables/Lists (Real-time WebSocket sync, purged on 0 members)
  * 4. '?!' Sync + Data Variables/Lists (Real-time sync + Firebase persistence on 0 members)
+ * 5. The same for works played in the tessvm runner (window.tessvm, no window.Entry)
  */
 (function () {
     const PREFIX_DATA_ONLY = '??';
@@ -1163,13 +1164,257 @@
         }
